      "severity": "CONCERN",
      "title": "Truncated-day scan misses sessions with no in-session bars",
      "description": "The inner join includes only bars within each session, and the `HAVING` clause can only report sessions that have such a bar. If a previous firing deleted a gap row after receiving only a midnight spillover bar\u2014or no in-session bars\u2014the session is omitted from this index. The coarse coverage index can still mark that UTC day covered, so `uncovered_days` will not restore the missing gap and the session can remain uncollected. Consider detecting sessions with no qualifying in-session bars as well as sessions whose newest bar is at the open.",
